3995..4068 Comment "/// Scope extrusion beside garbage collection where `out` takes a channel"
4069..4145 Comment "/// (Milner, _Communicating and Mobile Systems: the π-Calculus_, CUP 1999)."
4146..4223 Comment "/// Collection rewrites the restriction extrusion matches, and the overlap is"
4224..4299 Comment "/// decided as a higher-order critical pair (Mayr and Nipkow, _Higher-order"
4300..4377 Comment "/// rewrite systems and their confluence_, TCS 1998), each variable a pattern"
4378..4455 Comment "/// over the channels it may name (Miller, _A logic programming language with"
4456..4528 Comment "/// lambda-abstraction, function variables, and simple unification_, JLC"
4529..4606 Comment "/// 1991): extrusion\'s `p` may name the restriction\'s channel and its `q` may"
4607..4680 Comment "/// not, collection\'s `p` may not. Composed, the peak restricts a channel"
4681..4753 Comment "/// neither process names, and both rewrites reach the two side by side."
